---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="35+ Best WhatsApp Business Auto Reply Message Samples (Copy & Paste) | LinkWA"
  description="Free copy-and-paste WhatsApp Business auto reply message samples for customer support, lead generation, after-hours away messages, and sales."
  canonical="https://linkwa.in/blog/whatsapp-business-auto-reply-message-samples"
>

<!-- JSON-LD FAQ Schema for Google Search Rich Snippets -->
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a good auto reply message for WhatsApp Business?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A good WhatsApp auto-reply is friendly, acknowledges the customer's inquiry immediately, states your expected response time, and provides an actionable link to your website or catalog."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the best WhatsApp away messages for after-hours?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "An effective after-hours message clearly states your office opening hours, reassures the user their message was received, and offers links to self-service resources or FAQs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I format WhatsApp auto reply messages with bold and emojis?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes! Use asterisks (*text*) for bold, underscores (_text_) for italics, and bullet points or emojis to make your automated messages engaging and readable."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<article class="article-wrap">
  <div class="article-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article-tag">Template Library · 35+ Samples</div>
      <h1>35+ Best WhatsApp Business Auto Reply Message Samples (Copy & Paste)</h1>
      <div class="article-meta"><span>Published August 2026</span><span>·</span><span>7 min read</span><span>·</span><span>Author: Social Ninja's Growth Team</span></div>
      <p class="article-intro">Looking for high-converting automated message templates for your business? Here are 35+ copy-and-paste WhatsApp auto-reply message samples organized by industry, purpose, and customer intent.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Personalize these templates by replacing the bracketed items like <code>[Company Name]</code>, <code>[Website URL]</code>, and <code>[Operating Hours]</code>. Use WhatsApp formatting like <code>*bold*</code> and emojis to boost readability!
      </div>

      <h2>Quick Jump Navigation</h2>
      <ul class="toc-list">
        <li><a href="#welcome">1. General Welcome & Greeting Samples (1–7)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#away">2. After-Hours & Holiday Away Messages (8–14)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sales">3. Sales & Lead Qualification Samples (15–21)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#support">4. Customer Support & Issue Resolution (22–27)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ecommerce">5. E-Commerce & Order Tracking Messages (28–32)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">6. Real Estate, Healthcare & Appointments (33–37)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faqs">7. Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
      </ul>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="welcome">1. General Welcome & Greeting Samples</h2>
      <p>Greet new prospects warmly and set clear response expectations:</p>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #1 · Professional & Crisp</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hello! 👋 Thank you for contacting *[Company Name]*. We have received your message and an agent will be with you in just a few moments. How can we help you today?
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #2 · Menu-Driven Interactive Greeting</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hi! Welcome to *[Company Name]*. 🌟&#10;&#10;To get you to the right department faster, please reply with a number:&#10;1️⃣ Talk to Sales / Get a Quote&#10;2️⃣ Check Existing Order / Booking&#10;3️⃣ Technical Support&#10;4️⃣ Speak to an Agent&#10;&#10;Or visit: [Website URL]
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #3 · Casual & Modern Brand</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hey there! Thanks for stopping by *[Brand Name]*. ☕ Our team is currently reviewing incoming messages. Drop your question below, and we’ll get back to you shortly!
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="away">2. After-Hours & Holiday Away Messages</h2>
      <p>Inform customers when you are offline without losing their interest:</p>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #4 · Standard After-Hours Notice</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hi! Thanks for reaching out to *[Company Name]*. 🌙&#10;&#10;Our offices are currently closed. Our team operates Monday to Friday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM.&#10;&#10;We’ve safely recorded your message and will reply as soon as we open tomorrow morning!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #5 · Weekend Auto-Responder</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Happy weekend! 🌴 Our support team is currently out of office until Monday at 9:00 AM. For common questions, check our self-service center: [Help Center URL]. We'll contact you first thing Monday!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #6 · National Holiday Closure</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Happy [Holiday Name] from all of us at *[Company Name]*! 🎊 Our team is celebrating with family today. We will resume normal support on [Date]. Enjoy the holiday!
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="sales">3. Sales & Lead Qualification Samples</h2>
      <p>Turn incoming messages into qualified appointments and paying clients:</p>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #7 · Agency Growth Consultation</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hi [Name]! Thanks for reaching out to *[Agency Name]*. 📈 To prepare for our conversation, could you share:&#10;&#10;• Your company name & website&#10;• Your monthly marketing budget&#10;• Your primary growth objective&#10;&#10;An account director will review your details immediately!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #8 · Direct Calendar Booking Link</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Thanks for your interest in *[Product/Service]*! 🚀 Want to skip the queue? Pick a 15-minute demo slot that fits your schedule directly on our calendar: [Calendly/Cal.com Link]
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="support">4. Customer Support & Issue Resolution</h2>
      <p>Reassure frustrated users and reduce support ticket volume:</p>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #9 · Support Ticket Confirmation</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hi there! 🛠️ Your support request has been logged under Ticket #[TICKET_ID]. Our technical engineers are on it. Typical response time is under 20 minutes during business hours.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #10 · Known Service Maintenance Alert</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hello! We are currently performing scheduled maintenance on [Service Name]. All systems are expected to be fully restored by [Time]. Track real-time status here: [Status Page URL]
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="ecommerce">5. E-Commerce & Order Tracking Messages</h2>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #11 · Instant Order Tracking</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hi! 📦 Thanks for shopping with *[Store Name]*. To track your shipment, reply with your *Order Number* (e.g., #1042) or track it directly here: [Tracking URL]
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #12 · Return & Exchange Inquiries</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Need to exchange or return an item? No problem! 🔄 Please check our hassle-free 14-day return policy and submit your return request here: [Returns Portal URL]
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="services">6. Real Estate, Healthcare & Appointments</h2>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #13 · Real Estate Property Inquiries</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Hello! Thanks for your interest in our property listings at *[Realty Brand]*. 🏡 Please let us know your preferred location, budget, and configuration (2BHK / 3BHK / Villa), and our property advisor will share curated brochures!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="template-card">
        <div class="template-badge">Sample #14 · Clinic / Medical Appointment</div>
        <div class="template-body">
          Welcome to *[Clinic Name]*. 🩺 Our reception team is available Mon–Sat, 8 AM–8 PM. To request a doctor's appointment, please reply with your *Full Name* and *Preferred Date/Time*.
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="faqs">7. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I copy these templates into WhatsApp Business?</h3>
        <p>Highlight any template box above, copy the text, open WhatsApp Business on your phone, navigate to <strong>Business Tools > Greeting message / Away message / Quick replies</strong>, paste the text, and save.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can I add variables like customer name automatically?</h3>
        <p>The standard WhatsApp Business app does not support dynamic tag replacement like <code>&#123;&#123;name&#125;&#125;</code> natively. To send personalized automated campaigns with dynamic names, you need the official WhatsApp Business Cloud API.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I create pre-filled message links for my marketing campaigns?</h3>
        <p>Use <a href="/">LinkWA's Free WhatsApp Link Generator</a> to generate instant, click-to-chat links with custom pre-filled text for your social media bios, Google Maps listings, and website buttons.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA Banner -->
    <div class="article-cta">
      <h3>Ready to Automate Your WhatsApp Funnel?</h3>
      <p>Generate clean, branded WhatsApp links with pre-filled keywords using LinkWA.</p>
      <a href="/" class="article-cta-btn">Create Free WhatsApp Link →</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Articles -->
    <div class="related-section">
      <h3>Related WhatsApp Marketing Guides</h3>
      <div class="related-grid">
        <a href="/blog/whatsapp-business-auto-reply-setup" class="related-card">
          <h4>How to Set Up WhatsApp Business Auto-Replies (Tutorial)</h4>
          <span>Read guide →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/how-to-create-whatsapp-link" class="related-card">
          <h4>How to Create a WhatsApp Link with Custom Text</h4>
          <span>Read guide →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/whatsapp-link-website-widget" class="related-card">
          <h4>How to Add a Floating WhatsApp Widget to Your Website</h4>
          <span>Read guide →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-nav"><a href="/blog" class="back-link">← Back to all articles</a></div>
  </div>
</article>
</Base>

<style>
.article-wrap { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
.article-hero { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gll) 0%, var(--bg) 100%); padding: 4.5rem 0 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bd); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
.article-tag { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gm); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.article-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 42px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 840px; color: var(--ink); }
.article-meta { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink3); display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.article-intro { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 740px; }

.callout { background: rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid var(--g); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; }
.toc-list { background: var(--surface, #f8fafc); border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 24px 20px 40px; margin: 20px 0 30px; }
.toc-list li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14.5px; }
.toc-list a { color: var(--gm); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
.toc-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

.template-card { background: var(--surface, #fff); border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); position: relative; }
.template-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; color: var(--gm); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.template-body { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); background: #f8fafc; border: 1px dashed var(--bd); padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line; }

.faq-item { background: var(--surface, #fff); border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.faq-item h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink); }
.faq-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

.article-cta { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gd), var(--gm)); border-radius: 18px; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; margin-top: 3.5rem; text-align: center; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(17,140,79,0.25); }
.article-cta h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.article-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 500px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.article-cta-btn { background: #fff; color: var(--gd); padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-display); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); transition: transform 0.15s; }
.article-cta-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

.related-section { margin-top: 4rem; padding-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--bd); }
.related-section h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); }
.related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.related-card { background: var(--surface, #fff); border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
.related-card:hover { border-color: var(--gm); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
.related-card h4 { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
.related-card span { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gm); }

.article-nav { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
.back-link { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink3); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
.back-link:hover { color: var(--gm); }
</style>
